#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\" title=\"Recommendations\">\n"
"   * See [IBM Cloud SAML Federation Guide](https://www.ibm.com/products/tutorials/ibm-cloud-saml-federation-guide) for more information.\n"
"   * Refer to the full [App ID documentation](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/appid?topic=appid-getting-started).\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\" title=\"推奨事項\">\n"
"   * 詳細については、[IBM Cloud SAML フェデレーションガイド](https://www.ibm.com/products/tutorials/ibm-cloud-saml-federation-guide)を参照してください。\n"
"   * [App IDドキュメント](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/appid?topic=appid-getting-started)の全文も参照してください。\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
